:18","text":"The G15 was an awesome camera.  I've been basically wearing it on me for 3 years and it is amazing it survived as well as it did.  That said, I'm guess I should have stopped using it about 6 months ago at least based on some of my photos. :)"},{"author":"88379351@N00","date":"2016-08-10 03:25:11","text":"I have been using a G9X for a couple of months.  Very happy with it.  enjoy"},{"author":"99357189@N00","date":"2016-08-10 20:35:46","text":"Yay!"},{"author":"118932233@N04","date":"2016-08-12 13:05:17","text":"...hot cam porn !!!!!"}],"description":"","detail":"photos/0109.json","filename":"28843044826_4a321f33fc_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/28843044826/","height":2273,"id":"28843044826","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/28843044826/28843044826_4a321f33fc_o.jpg","sha256":"4084b9a6854615a061a2ad36e546051f7938e21b0cb967377a5290b41067c4c8","tags":["new camera","canon","g9x","port townsend","pt","Washington","wa"],"taken":"2016-07-05 14:21:59","title":"IMG_7670","uploaded":"2016-08-09 10:16:56","width":3999},"28843052056":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":6436}],"bytes":3094407,"camera_position":6436,"comments":[],"description":"","detail":"photos/0109.json","filename":"28843052056_06740f5a05_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/28843052056/","height":1967,"id":"28843052056","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/28843052056/28843052056_06740f5a05_o.jpg","sha256":"4fd926e647664bf9d7218f19b9be99eb2b80e8ef0f46c53903840fc6c0ea2f4a","tags":["port townsend","pt","Washington","wa"],"taken":"2016-07-05 12:46:52","title":"IMG_7661","uploaded":"2016-08-09 10:17:25","width":3917},"28852555525":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":6435},{"id":"72157663453672647","position":7}],"bytes":3663712,"camera_position":6435,"comments":[],"description":"","detail":"photos/0109.json","filename":"28852555525_13f9129ebc_o.jpg",